  ⚠ Start a git repository in /srv/files-example and take it over?                                                      
                                                                                                                        
  Yes looks at the folder once more and makes the changes listed below only if its list is unchanged. Containers of     
  these stacks already run, so deploying would create duplicate containers and take their ports twice. qhost only warns.
                                                                                                                        
    folder: /srv/files-example                                                                                          
    case: files (files without a repository; a first commit takes the listed files)                                     
    owner: root, group: root, mode: 0755                                                                                
    the service can write it: no                                                                                        
    permissions are set: yes                                                                                            
                                                                                                                        
  Files of the first commit (2)                                                                                         
    demo/.env                                                                                                           
    demo/compose.yaml                                                                                                   
                                                                                                                        
  Unclear files (2), data or a secret may be in them                                                                    
    They stay out unless you choose them; choosing replans the folder. A chosen file with secret content is still       
    checked before anything is pushed.                                                                                  
    [ ] demo/acme.json: writable-file                                                                                   
    [ ] demo/secrets/db.txt: secrets-file                                                                               
y yes, do it  w with a remote  c choose files  n/esc/enter cancel                                      ↑/↓ scroll  20/40
